EXHAUSTIVE=HAUR+[['英语 exhaustive：exhaust + -ive；另有中古拉丁 exhaustivus 借入说','将范围中的可能性用尽 → 无遗漏、详尽']]
W += [
E('exhaust','/ɪɡˈzɔːst/','使精疲力竭；用尽；排气、废气','像把桶里的水抽干：力气、资源、可能办法都可以被用到所剩无几。','拉丁 ex- 向外 + haurire 汲取 → exhaurire，其分词 exhaustus 借入英语；名词排气义再由动词发展。',EXHAUST+[['英语名词 exhaust','排出去的气体；后来也指发动机排气系统']],'exhaust supplies 是耗尽物资；exhaust all options 是用尽可行办法；car exhaust 是汽车废气或排气装置。看到 exhaust 不要一律译成人很累。','exhaust resources；exhaust all possibilities；exhaust fumes；an exhaust pipe。','tire 是使疲劳；exhaust 程度通常更深。exhaust 与 exit 不是同一词，前者核心是抽出、耗尽。',('The search exhausted our supply of batteries.','这次搜寻耗尽了我们的电池。'),('The long journey exhausted the whole family.','长途旅行让全家都精疲力竭。'),('The mechanic replaced the damaged exhaust pipe.','机械师更换了损坏的排气管。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/exhaust','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhaust#English']),
E('exhausted','/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪd/','筋疲力尽的；耗尽的','像电池已经见底：人几乎没力气，物资也可能已经用完。','exhaust + -ed；过去分词形容词描述受到耗尽作用后的状态。',EXHAUST+[['英语 exhaust + -ed → exhausted','使耗尽 → 已耗尽、极疲惫的']],'feel exhausted 是非常疲惫；exhausted supplies 是已耗尽的物资。人累和资源耗尽都接同一个抽空画面。','feel exhausted；physically exhausted；an exhausted supply。','exhausted 是感到累，exhausting 是让人累。tired 可很普通，exhausted 通常更强。',('By the time we reached the hotel, we were exhausted.','到达酒店时，我们已经筋疲力尽。'),('Once the supplies were exhausted, the team had to return.','物资一耗尽，团队就不得不返回。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/exhausted','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhausted']),
E('exhausting','/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪŋ/','令人精疲力竭的；消耗大的','这件事像不断从人身上抽走精力，做完很难再动。','exhaust + -ing；分词形容词强调造成耗竭的事物或活动。',EXHAUST+[['英语 exhaust + -ing → exhausting','使精疲力竭 → 令人疲惫的']],'an exhausting day 是让人累坏的一天；emotionally exhausting 是精神情绪上耗费巨大。活动不必有很多体力劳动。','an exhausting journey；emotionally exhausting；find something exhausting。','exhausting 说让人累；exhaustive 说检查、说明等无遗漏，不是更高级的累。',('Moving house was more exhausting than we expected.','搬家比我们预想的更累人。'),('The constant arguments became emotionally exhausting.','持续不断的争吵让人在情绪上疲惫不堪。'),sources=['https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhausting','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhausting#English']),
E('exhaustion','/ɪɡˈzɔːstʃən/','精疲力竭；耗尽','把力气或资源被抽空后的状态，作为一个名词来讲。','现代对应 exhaust + -ion；词源也有从中古拉丁 exhaustio 借入的分析，两条都接 exhaurire 耗尽。',HAUR+[['英语 exhaust + -ion；或中古拉丁 exhaustio 借入 → exhaustion','抽尽力量、物资 → 极度疲劳、耗尽状态']],'physical exhaustion 是身体极度疲劳；the exhaustion of reserves 是储备耗尽。词尾 -tion 在这里读 /tʃən/，不要套用所有 -tion 的 /ʃən/。','physical/mental exhaustion；the exhaustion of resources；to the point of exhaustion。','exhaustion 是状态，exhaustive 是范围全面；词根相同，实际指向不同。',('She fell asleep almost immediately from exhaustion.','她累得几乎一躺下就睡着了。'),('The report warns about the exhaustion of local water reserves.','报告警示当地水资源储备可能耗尽。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/exhaustion','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhaustion#English','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhaustion']),
E('exhaustive','/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪv/','详尽无遗的；穷尽所有情况的','把该查、该说的可能项都过一遍，直到范围里没剩下漏项。','现代可拆 exhaust + -ive；也有中古拉丁 exhaustivus 借入说。核心从用尽转到把议题中的各部分都谈尽。',EXHAUSTIVE,'an exhaustive search 是穷尽相关范围的搜寻；an exhaustive list 力求列全。长不等于全面，一张很长的清单也可能漏掉关键类型。','an exhaustive list；exhaustive testing；an exhaustive review。','exhausting 让人累，exhaustive 没遗漏。extensive 强调范围广，仍不必覆盖所有项目。',('The report provides an exhaustive account of the investigation.','报告详尽地叙述了整个调查过程。'),('The examples are useful, but the list is not exhaustive.','这些例子很有用，但这份清单并未列全。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/exhaustive','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhaustive#English','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhaustive']),
E('exhaustively','/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪvli/','全面彻底地；穷尽地','检查或讨论时一项项覆盖，尽量不让范围里留下空白。','exhaustive + -ly；说明工作的覆盖程度，而不是人的疲惫程度。',EXHAUSTIVE+[['英语 exhaustive + -ly → exhaustively','详尽无遗的 → 穷尽地、全面地']],'exhaustively test a system 是充分覆盖相关情况来测试系统；discuss exhaustively 是把议题各方面都谈到。范围需由上下文界定。','test exhaustively；examine exhaustively；discuss exhaustively。','exhaustedly 是精疲力竭地，exhaustively 是覆盖详尽地。一个强调感受，一个强调工作范围。',('The committee examined the available evidence exhaustively.','委员会全面详查了现有证据。'),('The appendix discusses the classification rules exhaustively.','附录详尽讨论了分类规则。'),sources=['https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhaustively','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhaustively#English']),
E('exhaustible','/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪbəl/','可能耗尽的；有限、会用完的','储量再大也有底，持续取用最终可能见空。','exhaust + -ible 能被……的；说能够被耗尽。',EXHAUST+[['英语 exhaust + -ible → exhaustible','耗尽 → 可能被耗尽的']],'exhaustible resources 是会耗尽的资源；a finite supply is exhaustible 强调数量终有上限。可用于实际物资，也可比喻耐心等。','exhaustible resources；an exhaustible supply；exhaustible reserves。','exhausted 是已经用完，exhaustible 是可能用完；可能性和当前状态不同。',('The study compares renewable resources with exhaustible reserves.','研究比较了可再生资源与可能耗尽的储备。'),('Even a large stock of spare parts is exhaustible.','即使很大的备用零件库存，也可能用完。'),sources=['https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/exhaustible#English','https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/exhaustible']),
E('inexhaustible','/ˌɪnɪɡˈzɔːstəbəl/','取之不尽的；似乎无穷的','像总能再舀出一瓢的水源，用来形容资源、点子或精力多得惊人。','in- 不 + exhaustible 可耗尽的；不是 in- 在里面。',EXHAUST+[['英语 exhaustible + in- → inexhaustible','可能用完 → 不能耗尽、似乎无穷的']],'an inexhaustible supply of stories 是讲不完的故事；inexhaustible energy 常是夸张赞美。涉及实际资源时，不能把修辞直接当作科学测量结论。','an inexhaustible supply；inexhaustible energy；an inexhaustible source of。','unlimited 强调不设限或无限；inexhaustible 更突出反复使用仍不见底的感觉。',('Her grandfather seemed to have an inexhaustible supply of stories.','她祖父好像有讲不完的故事。'),('The children approached the game with apparently inexhaustible energy.','孩子们以仿佛用不完的精力投入游戏。'),sources=['https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/inexhaustible','https://www.etymonline.com/word/inexhaustible']),
E('nonexhaustive','构词参考：英 /ˌnɒnɪɡˈzɔːstɪv/；美 /ˌnɑːnɪɡˈzɔːstɪv/','未列尽的；并未穷尽全部情况的','这只是其中一些例子，后面还有没写出来的。','non- 不 + exhaustive 全面无遗漏；也常写作 non-exhaustive，这里收录连写形式。',EXHAUSTIVE+[['英语 non- + exhaustive → nonexhaustive','全面无遗漏 → 未穷尽全部的']],'a nonexhaustive list 是示例性清单，不保证包含全部项目。并不表示列出的内容有错，只是范围没有列满。','a nonexhaustive list；a nonexhaustive overview；nonexhaustive examples。','inaccurate 是不准确；nonexhaustive 是不全面。unexhausted 则是未耗尽，意思又不同。',('The guide offers a nonexhaustive list of useful resources.','指南列出了一些有用资源，但并非完整清单。'),('This nonexhaustive overview highlights the main approaches.','这份并未涵盖全部内容的概览重点介绍了主要方法。'),sources=['https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nonexhaustive#English','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/exhaustive']),
]
